{"title":"Education Consultant Roadmap","role":"Education Consultant","summary":"An Education Consultant helps schools, educational institutions, teachers, students, parents, NGOs, EdTech companies, or education-focused organizations improve learning outcomes, curriculum delivery, academic processes, teacher development, and educational programs.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Ed (Bachelor of Education)","Course":"B.Ed - Subject Pedagogy (Science / Maths / Social Studies / Languages / Commerce)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Education Consultant helps schools, educational institutions, teachers, students, parents, NGOs, EdTech companies, or education-focused organizations improve learning outcomes, curriculum delivery, academic processes, teacher development, and educational programs."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Ed graduate, the strongest entry pathway is to combine subject pedagogy + classroom experience + curriculum design + educational technology + data/assessment skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the organization, an Education Consultant may work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum and lesson-plan development"},{"text":"Teacher training and professional development"},{"text":"Academic quality improvement"},{"text":"School improvement programs"},{"text":"Student learning assessments"},{"text":"EdTech implementation"},{"text":"Educational content development"},{"text":"Career and academic guidance"},{"text":"Learning-outcome analysis"},{"text":"Education program management"},{"text":"NEP-aligned educational initiatives"},{"text":"School accreditation and quality processes"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"“Education Consultant” is generally not a single regulated professional title. Responsibilities vary considerably between schools, EdTech companies, consultancies, NGOs, government projects, and independent consulting."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Stage","Possible Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Academic Coordinator, Education Program Associate, Curriculum Associate, Teacher Trainer – Junior, Academic Counselor"}],[{"text":"2–4 Years"},{"text":"Education Consultant, Curriculum Specialist, Learning Designer, Academic Manager"}],[{"text":"4–7 Years"},{"text":"Senior Education Consultant, Instructional Designer, School Improvement Specialist"}],[{"text":"7–10+ Years"},{"text":"Education Program Manager, Learning & Development Lead, Education Strategy Consultant"}],[{"text":"Long Term"},{"text":"Education Strategist, Independent Education Consultant, Education Program Director, EdTech Learning Lead"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the B.Ed","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Build Teaching & Pedagogy Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on understanding how students learn and how effective teaching is designed."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Educational psychology"},{"text":"Child/adolescent development"},{"text":"Learning theories"},{"text":"Pedagogical approaches"},{"text":"Classroom management"},{"text":"Inclusive education"},{"text":"Assessment fundamentals"},{"text":"Subject-specific pedagogy"},{"text":"Lesson planning"},{"text":"Teaching-learning materials"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Work"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lesson plans"},{"text":"Teaching-learning materials"},{"text":"Worksheets"},{"text":"Subject activities"},{"text":"Classroom assessments"},{"text":"Concept maps"},{"text":"Digital learning resources"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For example, a Science pedagogy student should be able to design:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Learning Objective","Concept Introduction","Demonstration / Activity","Student Exploration","Assessment","Feedback","Learning Improvement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Build Curriculum & Educational Technology Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Move beyond simply teaching a lesson."},{"text":"Understand how an entire learning program is designed."}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum design"},{"text":"Instructional design"},{"text":"Learning outcomes"},{"text":"Competency-based education"},{"text":"Bloom's Taxonomy"},{"text":"Formative assessment"},{"text":"Summative assessment"},{"text":"Rubric development"},{"text":"Educational technology"},{"text":"LMS platforms"},{"text":"Digital classrooms"},{"text":"Online teaching"},{"text":"Content development"},{"text":"Basic educational data analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Digital Skills"},{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Importance"],"rows":[[{"text":"MS Excel / Google Sheets"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"PowerPoint / Google Slides"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Medium–High"}],[{"text":"LMS platforms"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Google Classroom"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Moodle"},{"text":"Medium"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Medium–High"}],[{"text":"AI educational tools"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Optional"}],[{"text":"Digital assessment tools"},{"text":"High"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 / Final Stage — Build Consulting Capability"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where the student should transition from “teacher mindset” → “education problem-solver mindset.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Why students are underperforming"},{"text":"Why teachers struggle with particular concepts"},{"text":"Curriculum gaps"},{"text":"Assessment quality"},{"text":"School-level learning outcomes"},{"text":"Teacher training requirements"},{"text":"Technology adoption challenges"},{"text":"Student engagement"},{"text":"Parent/student feedback"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A consultant should be able to move from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Data Collection","Root-Cause Analysis","Solution Design","Implementation","Measurement","Improvement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Professional Skills"},{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","What to Learn"],"rows":[[{"text":"Teaching"},{"text":"Lesson planning, classroom delivery"}],[{"text":"Pedagogy"},{"text":"Subject-specific teaching strategies"}],[{"text":"Curriculum"},{"text":"Curriculum mapping and development"}],[{"text":"Assessment"},{"text":"Tests, rubrics, learning outcomes"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Educational research methods"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Presentation, facilitation, stakeholder communication"}],[{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Problem identification and solution design"}],[{"text":"Training"},{"text":"Teacher workshops and professional development"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Excel, dashboards, learning analytics"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"LMS, EdTech platforms, AI tools"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Reports, proposals, curriculum documents"}],[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Planning, execution, monitoring"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Subject Pedagogy Specialization"},{"type":"p","text":"The student's B.Ed subject should become their domain advantage."},{"type":"h","text":"Science Pedagogy"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inquiry-based learning"},{"text":"STEM education"},{"text":"Laboratory learning"},{"text":"Scientific reasoning"},{"text":"Experiential learning"},{"text":"Science curriculum design"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential consulting specialization:"},{"type":"h","text":"STEM Education Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics Pedagogy"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem-based learning"},{"text":"Mathematical reasoning"},{"text":"Numeracy development"},{"text":"Conceptual learning"},{"text":"Math assessment"},{"text":"Learning difficulties"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential specialization:"},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics Curriculum Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Social Studies Pedagogy"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Civics education"},{"text":"Geography education"},{"text":"History education"},{"text":"Social science research"},{"text":"Experiential/social learning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential specialization:"},{"type":"h","text":"Social Science Curriculum Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Language Pedagogy"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Language acquisition"},{"text":"Reading comprehension"},{"text":"Writing development"},{"text":"Communication skills"},{"text":"Literacy programs"},{"text":"Language assessment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential specialization:"},{"type":"h","text":"Language & Literacy Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Commerce Pedagogy"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial literacy"},{"text":"Accounting education"},{"text":"Business studies"},{"text":"Economics education"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship education"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential specialization:"},{"type":"h","text":"Commerce & Financial Education Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Curriculum Design Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Educational Need","Learner Profile","Learning Outcomes","Curriculum Mapping","Content Selection","Learning Activities","Assessment Design","Teacher Resources","Implementation","Learning Analytics","Curriculum Improvement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Educational Assessment Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong consultant should understand how to determine whether students are actually learning."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Diagnostic assessment"},{"text":"Formative assessment"},{"text":"Summative assessment"},{"text":"Competency-based assessment"},{"text":"Question-paper design"},{"text":"Rubrics"},{"text":"Performance assessment"},{"text":"Learning outcomes"},{"text":"Item analysis"},{"text":"Student progress tracking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of saying:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Students performed poorly.”"},{"type":"p","text":"A consultant should identify:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Class Average ↓","Topic-Level Analysis"]},{"type":"note","label":"Fractions","text":"72%"},{"type":"note","label":"Algebra","text":"48%"},{"type":"note","label":"Geometry","text":"81%"},{"type":"flow","items":["Identify Algebra Learning Gap","Teacher Intervention","Remedial Learning","Post-Assessment","Measure Improvement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Educational Data & Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"This is an excellent differentiator in the AI era."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Basic dashboards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Student performance"},{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Assessment scores"},{"text":"Subject-wise performance"},{"text":"Teacher performance indicators"},{"text":"Learning gaps"},{"text":"Student engagement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Student Data","Excel / LMS","Data Cleaning","Power BI","Performance Dashboard","Learning Gap Identification","Intervention"]},{"type":"h","text":"AI in Education"},{"type":"p","text":"AI literacy can significantly strengthen an Education Consultant profile."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how AI can support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lesson-plan generation"},{"text":"Personalized learning"},{"text":"Question generation"},{"text":"Automated feedback"},{"text":"Learning analytics"},{"text":"Curriculum mapping"},{"text":"Content adaptation"},{"text":"Student tutoring"},{"text":"Teacher assistants"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Educational research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI + Education Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Student Learning Data","AI / Analytics","Identify Learning Gaps","Personalized Resources","Teacher Intervention","Student Assessment","Measure Improvement"]},{"type":"p","text":"The consultant should understand how to evaluate AI outputs, not simply generate content with AI."},{"type":"h","text":"Teacher Training Capability"},{"type":"p","text":"Teacher development can become a major specialization."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to design workshops around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active learning"},{"text":"Classroom management"},{"text":"Assessment techniques"},{"text":"Digital teaching"},{"text":"AI for teachers"},{"text":"Inclusive education"},{"text":"STEM pedagogy"},{"text":"Competency-based education"},{"text":"Project-based learning"},{"text":"Experiential learning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Workshop Structure"},{"type":"flow","items":["Teacher Need","Training Objectives","Concept Session","Demonstration","Hands-on Activity","Practice","Feedback","Post-Training Evaluation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Educational Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop basic research capability."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Literature review"},{"text":"Survey design"},{"text":"Interview techniques"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"Report writing"},{"text":"Academic referencing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible research topics:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Impact of AI-assisted learning"},{"text":"Student engagement with digital classrooms"},{"text":"Effectiveness of project-based learning"},{"text":"Learning outcomes of blended learning"},{"text":"Teacher adoption of EdTech"},{"text":"AI literacy among teachers"},{"text":"Digital learning accessibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"}]},{"heading":"AI-Based Personalized Learning Framework","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Analyze student performance and recommend learning resources based on learning gaps."}]},{"heading":"Student Learning Analytics Dashboard","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Create a Power BI dashboard tracking:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Test scores"},{"text":"Subject performance"},{"text":"Learning gaps"},{"text":"Improvement trends"}]}]},{"heading":"AI-Assisted Lesson Planning System","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop a framework that helps teachers generate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learning objectives"},{"text":"Activities"},{"text":"Worksheets"},{"text":"Assessments"},{"text":"Differentiated resources"}]}]},{"heading":"Teacher Professional Development Program","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Design and evaluate a training program for teachers on AI-enabled education."}]},{"heading":"STEM Curriculum Intervention","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop a project-based STEM module and measure student learning outcomes before and after implementation."}]},{"heading":"Digital Learning Gap Study","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Research barriers affecting students' adoption and effectiveness of digital learning."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target organizations such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Schools"},{"text":"EdTech companies"},{"text":"Curriculum companies"},{"text":"Education NGOs"},{"text":"Teacher-training organizations"},{"text":"Educational consultancies"},{"text":"Assessment companies"},{"text":"Government education projects"},{"text":"Learning & Development organizations"},{"text":"EdTech startups"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Roles"},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic Intern"},{"text":"Curriculum Intern"},{"text":"Education Program Intern"},{"text":"Instructional Design Intern"},{"text":"Content Development Intern"},{"text":"Teacher Training Intern"},{"text":"Learning Experience Intern"},{"text":"Assessment Intern"},{"text":"Education Research Intern"},{"text":"EdTech Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A fresh B.Ed graduate may enter through:"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Core Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Academic Coordinator"},{"text":"Academic operations"}],[{"text":"Curriculum Associate"},{"text":"Curriculum development"}],[{"text":"Education Program Associate"},{"text":"Education projects"}],[{"text":"Instructional Design Associate"},{"text":"Learning experiences"}],[{"text":"Academic Counselor"},{"text":"Student guidance"}],[{"text":"Teacher Trainer – Junior"},{"text":"Teacher development"}],[{"text":"Content Developer"},{"text":"Educational content"}],[{"text":"Assessment Associate"},{"text":"Testing and evaluation"}],[{"text":"Learning Experience Associate"},{"text":"Digital learning"}],[{"text":"Education Research Assistant"},{"text":"Research and analysis"}],[{"text":"EdTech Implementation Associate"},{"text":"Technology adoption"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"After gaining relevant experience, these can lead toward Education Consultant roles."},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Requirement","Priority"],"rows":[[{"text":"B.Ed / Education qualification"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Subject pedagogy"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Teaching experience"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Curriculum development"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Presentation skills"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Assessment design"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Teacher training"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Educational research"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"LMS knowledge"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"AI in Education"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Report writing"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Instructional Design"},{"text":"Curriculum Design"},{"text":"Educational Assessment"},{"text":"Learning Analytics"},{"text":"Google Educator training"},{"text":"Microsoft education tools"},{"text":"LMS administration"},{"text":"AI in Education"},{"text":"Educational research"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Inclusive education"},{"text":"Special education fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term consulting, a M.Ed / MA Education / Educational Leadership / Curriculum & Instruction / Education Technology pathway can be valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"Higher Education Options"},{"type":"p","text":"After B.Ed, consider:"},{"type":"h","text":"Education"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Ed"},{"text":"M.A. Education"},{"text":"M.A. Educational Psychology"},{"text":"M.A. Curriculum & Instruction"},{"text":"M.A. Educational Leadership"},{"text":"M.A. Education Technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA"},{"text":"MBA Education Management"},{"text":"MBA Human Resources"},{"text":"MBA Operations / Project Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"For students interested in EdTech:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learning Sciences"},{"text":"Educational Technology"},{"text":"Learning Analytics"},{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"Instructional Technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Long-term academic/research route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Ed","M.Ed / MA Education","NET / Relevant Eligibility","Ph.D.","Education Research / Academia / Policy"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"p","text":"An Education Consultant can eventually specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Curriculum Consulting"},{"type":"h","text":"Teacher Training"},{"type":"h","text":"STEM Education Consulting"},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics Education"},{"type":"h","text":"Language & Literacy"},{"type":"h","text":"Assessment & Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"EdTech Consulting"},{"type":"h","text":"Learning Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"School Improvement"},{"type":"h","text":"Inclusive Education"},{"type":"h","text":"Education Policy"},{"type":"h","text":"Career Education"},{"type":"h","text":"Higher Education Consulting"},{"type":"h","text":"AI in Education"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Learning & Development"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Ed Graduate","Teacher / Academic Associate","Curriculum / Academic Coordinator","Education Program Specialist","Education Consultant","Senior Education Consultant","Education Strategy Consultant","Education Program Manager / Director","Education Strategist / Independent Consultant"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies to Learn"},{"type":"p","text":"The education sector is rapidly becoming technology-driven."},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"AI tutoring systems"},{"text":"Adaptive learning"},{"text":"Learning analytics"},{"text":"AI assessment"},{"text":"Virtual classrooms"},{"text":"AR/VR learning"},{"text":"Gamification"},{"text":"Digital credentials"},{"text":"Learning Experience Platforms (LXP)"},{"text":"Knowledge graphs"},{"text":"Educational chatbots"},{"text":"Speech-based learning"},{"text":"Accessibility technology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future profile is not simply:"},{"type":"h","text":"Teacher + AI"},{"type":"p","text":"but:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Pedagogy","Curriculum","Data","Technology","Consulting"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Education Foundation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Ed"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Subject Pedagogy"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Educational Psychology"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curriculum Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Teacher Training"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Educational Research"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Presentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"LMS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Digital Learning Tools"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Generative AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Consulting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Solution Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Implementation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Impact Measurement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By the end of B.Ed, the student should ideally be able to demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong subject pedagogy"},{"text":"Effective lesson planning"},{"text":"Classroom-management capability"},{"text":"Curriculum mapping"},{"text":"Assessment design"},{"text":"Educational research fundamentals"},{"text":"Teacher-training presentation skills"},{"text":"LMS and digital-learning familiarity"},{"text":"Excel-based education analytics"},{"text":"Basic Power BI dashboards"},{"text":"Responsible use of generative AI"},{"text":"Educational problem-solving"},{"text":"Professional report writing"},{"text":"Strong presentation and stakeholder communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio should contain"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"5+ Lesson Plans"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"2 Curriculum Maps"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"2 Assessment/Rubric Samples"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Educational Research Project"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Learning Analytics Dashboard"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Teacher Training Workshop"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 AI-in-Education Project"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 Internship / School Improvement Project"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Ed graduate targeting Education Consultant, the strongest career positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Subject Pedagogy","Curriculum Design","Assessment","Teacher Development","Education Analytics","AI/EdTech","Consulting"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination moves the graduate beyond a conventional teaching profile and prepares them for opportunities in schools, EdTech companies, curriculum organizations, education consultancies, NGOs, assessment organizations, and education-focused programs."}]}]}